use show, clear, report from benson

-- The Shrine (ADR 0084) owns its own Surface Region, its footprint: an object
-- left inside it is told here, and nowhere else. The energy crystal is taken
-- as an offering and fixed where it lies, so it can't be left here twice.
on received item
  if item = "energy crystal" then
    ask world to fix item
    report ["THE SHRINE", "ACCEPTS THE CRYSTAL", "IT WILL NOT BE MOVED"] and wait
    clear and wait
    return
  end if
  show "THE SHRINE IS INDIFFERENT" and wait
end received
